    "rating": null,
    "about": "Welcome to Elementum - where urban living meets community vibes! Nestled in the vibrant heart of Darmstadt, our stylish studio-living spaces offer the perfect blend of comfort and convenience.\nImagine five interconnected buildings designed to be your home away from home, just moments away from the TU University and the main train station.\nNeed a break from studying? Head up to our roof terrace for some chill vibes or join in the fun at our communal kitchen for impromptu pizza parties and lively conversations in the main study room.\nBut that's not all - at Elementum, we're all about bringing people together. Our jam-packed calendar of events ensures there's always something exciting happening, making it easy to meet new friends and forge lifelong connections.\nAnd when you're ready to explore beyond our cozy community, you'll find Darmstadt's buzzing student scene right at your doorstep. Plus, with Frankfurt and Heidelberg just a stone's throw away, the possibilities for adventure are endless.\nCome join us at Elementum, where every day is a chance to live, learn, and laugh together!",
